; The sum that gives an elided amount starts again when it reaches zero: the places of the terms before are forgotten.
2026-01-01 open Assets:A
2026-01-01 open Assets:L1
2026-01-01 open Assets:L2
2026-01-01 open Assets:Short
2026-01-01 open Equity:O

2026-01-02 * "a written integer and a cost cancel, then an integer"
  Assets:A  -1 BBB
  Assets:L1  0.5 CCC {2 BBB}
  Assets:L2  1 AAA {7 BBB}
  Equity:O

2026-01-03 * "two costs cancel, then a cost of whole units"
  Assets:L1  0.5 CCC {2 BBB}
  Assets:Short  -0.25 AAA {4 BBB}
  Assets:L2  1 DDD {7 BBB}
  Equity:O

2026-01-04 * "two costs cancel, then a cost with one place"
  Assets:L1  0.5 CCC {2 BBB}
  Assets:Short  -0.25 AAA {4 BBB}
  Assets:L2  1.5 DDD {2 BBB}
  Equity:O

2026-01-05 * "the zero comes last: nothing is forgotten after it"
  Assets:L2  1 DDD {7 BBB}
  Assets:A  -1 BBB
  Assets:L1  0.5 CCC {2 BBB}
  Equity:O

2026-01-06 * "control: the sum never reaches zero"
  Assets:A  -2 BBB
  Assets:L1  0.5 CCC {2 BBB}
  Assets:L2  1 AAA {7 BBB}
  Equity:O
